            "content": "<p><strong>Caring for your Jewellery</strong></p><p>This piece should be stored in a cool, dry place and cleaned carefully with a soft non-abrasive cloth to maintain shine.</p><p>Read our jewellery care guide to find out how best to care for your jewellery.</p>",
