          "type": "custom-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Sustainability",
            "content": "<h6>Carbon-Neutral Delivery</h6><p>We offer worldwide carbon-neutral shipping and returns. 100% of our packaging is now also recyclable.</p><h6>Responsibly Made</h6><p>Our products are handcrafted by our teams in India and Thailand. We have built relationships with these factories over 15 years – and they are regularly audited by the Responsible Jewellery Council.</p><h6>Consciously Sourced</h6><p>We only source conflict-free diamonds, and we are committed to using recycled metals – our goal is to work with our factories to further this with every new collection.</p>",
