          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I find the right size ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For rings, we advise you to check the top of the product page. There you can find just below the buy button, the \"Ring Size Converter\"<br/>By doing so, you will find the perfect size for you.</p>",
