        },
        "collapsible_row_397MBA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long until I have my jewelry?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Each piece in our collection is handcrafted with care, a process that takes approximately 3 to 5 days. Delivery time varies depending on the product ordered. Most items arrive within 5 to 12 business days</p><p>You will be notified of any delays. These are estimated timeframes and may be affected by factors such as material availability, order volume, and shipping destination.</p><p>If you have any questions about your order’s expected delivery date, our customer support team is available to assist you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ncFnnH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your Return Policy",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We take pride in offering more than just exquisite gems—we provide an experience built on trust and confidence.</p><p>If you're not completely satisfied with your order, we offer a 30-day return or exchange policy.</p><p>For more details, please refer to our Return Policy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6gmfVa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We aim to process and ship orders within 24-48 hours of placement.</p><p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive an email with tracking details, allowing you to monitor its progress. Simply use the provided tracking information on our delivery partner’s website to stay updated on your shipment.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
